{"sha": "5334f7d6cfaf67b828ef91680f7afd494a058e2cf70c3fa11d0968b50bfed106", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "展开：$s_1 + s_2 = (A_1\\cos\\varphi_1 + A_2\\cos\\varphi_2)\\cos\\omega t -", "(A_1\\sin\\varphi_1 + A_2\\sin\\varphi_2)\\sin\\omega t = X\\cos\\omega t -", "Y\\sin\\omega t = A\\cos(\\omega t + \\varphi)$ 其中 $A^2 = X^2 + Y^2 =", "A_1^2 + A_2^2 + 2A_1A_2(\\cos\\varphi_1\\cos\\varphi_2 + \\sin\\varphi_1\\sin\\varphi_2)$。", "几何上，$A$ 为两矢量之和的长度，这两矢量的长度分别为", "$A_1$、$A_2$，夹角为 $\\Delta\\varphi$（余弦定理）。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[同相的两个波源；光程差]\\label{prop:b1:wave-propagation:pathdiff}", "\\index{光程差}", "两个同相发射、波长为 $\\lambda$ 的波源，", "$d_1$、$d_2$ 分别是两波源到点 $M$ 的距离，两波到达 $M$ 时的相位差为", "$\\Delta\\varphi = 2\\pi\\,\\delta/\\lambda$，其中 $\\delta = d_2 - d_1$ 称为", "\\emph{光程差}。点 $M$ 处的干涉，相长的条件是", "$\\delta = n\\lambda$，相消的条件是 $\\delta = (n + \\tfrac12)\\lambda$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "每列波到达时带有其传播路程引起的相位滞后 $kd_i = 2\\pi d_i/\\lambda$", "（见\\cref{prop:b1:wave-propagation:sinusoidal}）；两者之差为", "$2\\pi(d_2 - d_1)/\\lambda$。运用\\cref{thm:b1:wave-propagation:fresnel}。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[两个扬声器]\\label{ex:b1:wave-propagation:speakers}", "两个扬声器相距 \\qty{2.0}{m}，发出相同的 \\qty{850}{Hz} 纯音，", "且同相（$\\lambda = \\qty{0.40}{m}$）。在中垂线上", "$\\delta = 0$ 处处都响。沿两扬声器的连线，位移每增加一个波长，$\\delta$", "改变 $2\\lambda$，因此安静点", "（$\\delta = \\pm\\lambda/2, \\pm 3\\lambda/2, \\dots$）每隔", "$\\lambda/2 = \\qty{20}{cm}$ 出现一处 --- 这是驻波，", "即下一节的主题。将一只扬声器的接线对调，使其反相发声，则", "响处与静处互换。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[杨氏双孔]\\label{ex:b1:wave-propagation:young}", "\\index{杨氏双孔}\\index{条纹间距}\\index{光程}", "两个针孔 $S_1$、$S_2$ 相距 $a$，由一个单色光源照明，", "（使二者同相发射），射向一块屏幕，", "屏幕距离为 $D \\gg a$。屏上距轴线高度为 $x$ 的一点处，", "光程差为", "\\[", "\\delta = S_2M - S_1M \\approx \\frac{a\\,x}{D}", "\\]", "（当 $x \\ll D$ 时：$S_{1,2}M = \\sqrt{D^2 + (x \\mp a/2)^2} \\approx D +", "(x \\mp a/2)^2/2D$，再相减）。亮条纹位于 $x = n\\lambda D/a$ 处，", "\\emph{条纹间距}为", "\\[", "i = \\frac{\\lambda D}{a} .", "\\]", "已知 $a = \\qty{0.50}{mm}$，$D = \\qty{2.0}{m}$，$\\lambda = \\qty{633}{nm}$：", "$i = \\qty{2.5}{mm}$ --- 用一把尺子即可测出光的波长。在", "折射率为 $n$ 的介质中，计算光程差应使用", "\\emph{光程}，即 $n \\times$ 长度，因为 $\\lambda = \\lambda_0/n$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  \\fill (0,0.4) circle (1.5pt) node[left] {$S_1$};", "  \\fill (0,-0.4) circle (1.5pt) node[left] {$S_2$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth] (-0.9,0.4) -- (-0.9,-0.4) node[midway, left] {$a$};", "  \\draw[thick] (5.6,-2.2) -- (5.6,2.2); \\node[above] at (5.6,2.2) {屏};", "  \\fill[omThm] (5.6,1.3) circle (1.5pt) node[right] {$M$};", "  \\draw[omDef] (0,0.4) -- (5.6,1.3); \\draw[omDef] (0,-0.4) -- (5.6,1.3);", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,0) -- (5.6,0) node[below right] {$O$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth] (5.9,0) -- (5.9,1.3) node[midway, right] {$x$};", "  \\draw[Stealth-Stealth] (0,-2.0) -- (5.6,-2.0) node[midway, below] {$D$};", "  \\node[omDef] at (2.8,1.2) {$d_1$}; \\node[omDef] at (3.3,0.28) {$d_2$};", "  % fringes pattern", "  \\begin{scope}[xshift=7.6cm]", "  \\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, width=4.2cm, height=5.2cm, xlabel={$I$}, ylabel={$x$},", "      xmin=0, xmax=4.6, ymin=-2.2, ymax=2.2, xtick={0,4}, xticklabels={$0$,$4I_0$},", "      ytick={-2,-1,0,1,2}, yticklabels={$-2i$,$-i$,$0$,$i$,$2i$}, anchor=origin, at={(0,0)}]", "    \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=-2.2:2.2, samples=300] ({4*cos(deg(pi*x))^2},{x});", "  \\end{axis}", "  \\end{scope}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 杨氏双孔：两个同相波源，相距 $a$，", "沿路径到达远处屏上的点 $M$，二者路径差为", "$\\delta \\approx ax/D$。屏上光强为 $4I_0\\cos^2(\\pi x/i)$，", "明暗条纹交替出现，条纹间距为 $i = \\lambda D/a$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[相干性]\\label{rem:b1:wave-propagation:coherence}", "\\index{相干性}", "菲涅耳公式假设相位差固定。两盏独立的灯", "各自的相位每秒随机跳变数十亿次；", "$\\cos\\Delta\\varphi$ 的平均值为零，因此光强只是简单相加，", "没有条纹。干涉需要\\emph{相干的}波源 --- 实际上，", "即同一光源发出的两列波，经两个小孔、两条狭缝、薄膜的两个表面，", "或分束器分出的两列波。由同一信号发生器驱动的两个扬声器", "是相干的；两位歌手则不是。", "\\end{remark}", "", "\\section{驻波}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[驻波]\\label{thm:b1:wave-propagation:standing}", "\\index{驻波}\\index{波节}\\index{波腹}", "振幅和频率均相同的两列正弦波，沿", "相反方向传播，叠加为", "\\[", "A\\cos(\\omega t - kx) + A\\cos(\\omega t + kx) = 2A\\cos(kx)\\cos(\\omega t),", "\\]", "这是\\emph{驻波}：每一点都同相（或反相）", "振动，振幅为 $2A\\abs{\\cos kx}$，随位置变化 ---", "在\\emph{波节}（$x = (n + \\tfrac12)\\lambda/2$）处为零，在", "\\emph{波腹}（$x = n\\lambda/2$）处最大；相邻波节相距 $\\lambda/2$。驻波", "中不存在波的传播：变量 $x$ 与 $t$ 已分离。", "\\end{theorem}", ""]}